Cause (existing behaviour since before 09a1b8e, not a lakeside/journey/hook regression): regionSelection picks the unfinished
attempt in forest-regional-r05-active (namespace dot-r5-v12-isolated-20261009:), the R5 provider restores it paused
(this.paused=true; only a fresh start clears it), and ManagedMobileBoardUI.presentForPlay deliberately opens the pause panel for
restored attempts; tool intros wait for run.ready, so the tutorial only came after 继续.
Fix: NativeWorldLevelAdapter sets ui.resumeRestoredOnPresent=requiresLakesideScene(selection); on reveal such a board resumes the
restored attempt directly (falls back to the pause panel if resume is refused). Saves untouched; first-time intros still show;
every other board keeps the explicit Resume. Test lakeside-landing-no-pause.
